From 640ba3056d1ec1cb8e88ba65e71055dc3f4e69c4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 17:33:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix hospital map, directions, navigation links and improve
 mobile UX

- Fix map not re-centering when user location is detected (useEffect
  now depends on center prop, adds panTo on location change)
- Add user location blue dot marker on the map
- Show info windows with distance and direct directions link on markers
- Fix directions URL to use lat/lng coordinates for precise navigation
- Remove duplicate "Explore the demo" dashboard button from hero,
  replace with "Explore features" linking to #features section
- Fix landing page nav links to use smooth scrolling with anchor tags
- Make hospital explorer filters collapsible on mobile with filter badge
- Compact hospital cards for better mobile readability
- Add smooth scroll CSS globally
- Fix demo hospital coordinates for Sparsh and Narayana Health City

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0168YGujGYiShQbPtQ6cYwQz
